      "content": "okay thanks. i'll try the whiskey and benadryl. but i'm looking at it again and it's actually a pretty deep hole, i can see into it a bit. and i'm starting to feel really shaky and my hand is throbbing like crazy. is that just the shock or should i be worried about things like tetanus or an infection spreading? i'm trying to avoid the doctor if i can, so should i just take some more benadryl to help with the throbbing?",
